# Roster

- No factions, units, or loadouts are locked.
- Do not invent a default roster, civ tree, or hero list and treat it as canon.
- If a task needs a unit, ask or use a clearly labeled placeholder.
- When the user does define a unit, keep it data-driven and consistent with existing definitions.
